<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 500 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 500 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 500 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 649 million, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The minimum and average accepted price was 86.86.</p>
<p>The average yield was flat at 19.95 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
